<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 21.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto (0755 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3756.28  59.76 points or 1.62 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
